'''''Deutzia pulchra''''', the '''beautiful deutzia''', is a species of flowering plant in the family [[Hydrangeaceae]].<ref name="RHS_31530" >{{cite web |title=''Deutzia pulchra'' beautiful deutzia |url=https://www.rhs.org.uk/plants/31530/deutzia-pulchra/details |date=2023 |publisher=The Royal Horticultural Society |access-date=10 December 2023 |quote=Buy this plant RHS Plants Shop ... 17 suppliers }}</ref> It is native to Taiwan and the Philippines.<ref name="POWO_790889-1" >{{cite POWO |id=790889-1 |title=''Deutzia pulchra'' S.Vidal |access-date=10 December 2023 }}</ref> A deciduous shrub reaching {{cvt|2.5|m|ft|0}}, it is readily available from commercial suppliers.<ref name="RHS_31530" />

